      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Modes: guided (5Q) · deep (15Q)\n\nBuilds 6 internal fields:\n  who_they_want_to_be\n  actions_that_person_takes\n  what_makes_it_attractive\n  environment\n  cue\n  two_minute_version\n\nWrites: conversation_memory\n         (agent='identity-gatherer')\nReads: identity_statement, profile ctx\n\n→ Closing recap → IDENTITY_GATHERER_SUMMARY",
