      "strokeColor": "#6d28d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Reads: conversation_memory summary\nReads: getProfileContext()\n\nGenerates exactly 5 habits:\n  identity_label  (\"I am a ___\")\n  habit_name\n  cue\n  two_minute_version\n  category\n\nQuick mode: skips Investigator,\n  uses quickHabitData directly\n\nWrites ALL 5 → proposed_habits\nUser picks ≤2 → habits (active)\nRemaining 3 → /add-habit at 7d streak\n\nSignal: HABITS_READY JSON",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reads: conversation_memory summary\nReads: getProfileContext()\n\nGenerates exactly 5 habits:\n  identity_label  (\"I am a ___\")\n  habit_name\n  cue\n  two_minute_version\n  category\n\nQuick mode: skips Investigator,\n  uses quickHabitData directly\n\nWrites ALL 5 → proposed_habits\nUser picks ≤2 → habits (active)\nRemaining 3 → /add-habit at 7d streak\n\nSignal: HABITS_READY JSON",
