      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Tables:\n  users\n  habits\n  habit_logs\n  habit_survey_responses\n  proposed_habits\n  conversation_memory\n  user_reflections\n  user_profile_context\n  tool_logs\n\nAuth: Supabase Auth\n  (email/password)\n  cookies via @supabase/ssr\n\nRLS: all tables\n  adminClient() server-only\n  browser client for reads\n\nAPI Routes:\n  /api/onboarding\n  /api/habits\n  /api/habits/[id]/log\n  /api/habits/[id]/streak\n  /api/habits/survey\n  /api/agents/constellation\n  /api/agents/architect\n  /api/memory/[agent]\n  /api/explore",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tables:\n  users\n  habits\n  habit_logs\n  habit_survey_responses\n  proposed_habits\n  conversation_memory\n  user_reflections\n  user_profile_context\n  tool_logs\n\nAuth: Supabase Auth\n  (email/password)\n  cookies via @supabase/ssr\n\nRLS: all tables\n  adminClient() server-only\n  browser client for reads\n\nAPI Routes:\n  /api/onboarding\n  /api/habits\n  /api/habits/[id]/log\n  /api/habits/[id]/streak\n  /api/habits/survey\n  /api/agents/constellation\n  /api/agents/architect\n  /api/memory/[agent]\n  /api/explore",
