    {
      "id": "text-ai",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1867.2181410551573,
      "y": 199.06076488405677,
      "width": 235,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9d174d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Claude API (lib/claude.ts)\n  Default: claude-sonnet-4-6\n  Switch via AGENT_MODEL env\n\nAgent Guard (lib/agentGuard.ts)\n  Log every tool call\n  Assert before model\n  Writes → tool_logs\n\nLangSmith Tracing\n  traceable() on all routes\n  LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2\n  Project: Habidy-Prompt-Eval\n\nEvals (evals/)\n  runModelComparison.ts\n  Run on every deploy\n\n  Core cases:\n  - empty_rag_retrieval\n  - null_user_memory\n  - db_save_failure\n  - user_overwhelm_attempt\n  - vague_identity_goal",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Claude API (lib/claude.ts)\n  Default: claude-sonnet-4-6\n  Switch via AGENT_MODEL env\n\nAgent Guard (lib/agentGuard.ts)\n  Log every tool call\n  Assert before model\n  Writes → tool_logs\n\nLangSmith Tracing\n  traceable() on all routes\n  LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2\n  Project: Habidy-Prompt-Eval\n\nEvals (evals/)\n  runModelComparison.ts\n  Run on every deploy\n\n  Core cases:\n  - empty_rag_retrieval\n  - null_user_memory\n  - db_save_failure\n  - user_overwhelm_attempt\n  - vague_identity_goal",
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 1742607083,
